{"id":"0dca0dd805702d93","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-transformation.md","title":"Proof Transformation","display":"df-proof-transformation — Proof Transformation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-transformation","aliases":["72-df-proof-transformation"],"display":"df-proof-transformation — Proof Transformation","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-tree]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.4 print36–42/PDF48–54; local relation definition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_expansion":"使结论保持谓词在任意输入关系上具有完整类型条件"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-transformation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-transformation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-transformation — Proof Transformation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.4 print36–42/PDF48–54; local relation definition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"使结论保持谓词在任意输入关系上具有完整类型条件"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的带标签演算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 是给定集合关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C,\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C,\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\\)</span> 为其有限证明集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofTransformation}(\\mathcal T;\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\times\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\\land\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\ \\forall\\rho,\\rho&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\\\n((\\langle\\pi,\\rho\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\land\\langle\\pi,\\rho&#39;\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T)\\to\\rho=\\rho&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ProofTransformation}(\\mathcal T;\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\times\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\\land\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\ \\forall\\rho,\\rho&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\\\n((\\langle\\pi,\\rho\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\land\\langle\\pi,\\rho&#39;\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T)\\to\\rho=\\rho&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PreservesConclusion}(\\mathcal T):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\times\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\\land\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\ \\forall\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\\\n(\\langle\\pi,\\rho\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\to\\operatorname{Concl}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PreservesConclusion}(\\mathcal T):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\times\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\\land\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\ \\forall\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\\\n(\\langle\\pi,\\rho\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\to\\operatorname{Concl}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不再以T已是部分函数为前提后重申相同条件；直接用集合关系与单值条件定义。去除不必要的normalization依赖与循环风险。</p>\n<p>旧 PreservesConclusion 对任意 T 中的两端直接调用仅为证明对象定义的 Concl；类型错误的 T 会使表达式无定义。现显式限制载体，并仅在合法证明域上量化投影。空关系满足两谓词；总性仍不是本定义要求。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D$ 为 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的带标签演算，$\\mathcal T$ 是给定集合关系，$\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C,\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D$ 为其有限证明集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C,\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProofTransformation}(\\mathcal T;\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\times\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\\land\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\ \\forall\\rho,\\rho'\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\\\n((\\langle\\pi,\\rho\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\land\\langle\\pi,\\rho'\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T)\\to\\rho=\\rho').","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PreservesConclusion}(\\mathcal T):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\times\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\\land\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\ \\forall\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal D\\\n(\\langle\\pi,\\rho\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\to\\operatorname{Concl}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).","display":true}],"bytes":2027,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-proof-transformation|df-proof-transformation — Proof Transformation]]"}],"outgoing":["81c9c855e009a6d4"]}